{"about_the_game":"<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend into the forgotten shafts of an abandoned island. Whatever lurks below was meant to stay buried forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Be Smarter and <i>Don't Get Caught</i>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481270/extras/397ce8dc57558a9c8906904778eeefb9.avif?t=1750717522\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481270/extras_big/397ce8dc57558a9c8906904778eeefb9.avif?t=1750717522 width=800 height=430 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Environment:</strong> Flickering lights, eerie soundscapes, and oppressive darkness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Threats:</strong> Monsters with unique behaviors stalk the player.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Storytelling:</strong> Story revealed through environmental clues and collectible notes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endgame Encounter:</strong> A dramatic showdown with the ultimate experiment deep within the shafts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481270/extras/ee9d67e92d39709a5fe44f10b4490747.avif?t=1750717522\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481270/extras_big/ee9d67e92d39709a5fe44f10b4490747.avif?t=1750717522 width=800 height=390 /></span></p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Silence Breaks","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3481270/938b55e1c04ce495ca95f8c620ea0